### Gorge Number One

After about an hour, the church tower of Hundwil comes into view.

<HikeImage idx={6} />

Before that, the route crosses the Urnäsch via the Old Tobel Bridge.
The roof beams of the covered bridge bear Christian quotations.

<HikeImage idx={7} />
<HikeImage idx={8} />
<HikeImage idx={9} />

Urnäsch is an ideal spot for a short first break to have a bite to eat.
<HikeImage idx={10} />
<HikeImage idx={11} />
